  "description": "Geometric flower mandala with damped harmonic oscillator physics. Each petal is a spring-mass system: \u03b6 from mids, \u03c9\u2080 from bass, underdamped motion x(t)=e^(-\u03b6\u03c9\u2080t)cos(\u03c9t). Bloom cycles triggered by bass. Temporal feedback, chromatic aberration, and ACES tone mapping.",
